title: TopicHub
---
<<SetShot "TwoShot">>

<<PrepareTopicChoices {GetCurrentActor()} "PlayerToCharacter" 3>>

-> Talk about {GetPreparedTopicDisplayName(0)} <<if HasPreparedTopic(0)>>
    <<PlayPreparedTopic 0>>
    <<jump TopicHub>>

-> Talk about {GetPreparedTopicDisplayName(1)} <<if HasPreparedTopic(1)>>
    <<PlayPreparedTopic 1>>
    <<jump TopicHub>>

-> Talk about {GetPreparedTopicDisplayName(2)} <<if HasPreparedTopic(2)>>
    <<PlayPreparedTopic 2>>
    <<jump TopicHub>>

-> Think of something else <<if CanRefreshPreparedTopics()>>
    Prince: Let me think again.
    <<jump TopicHub>>

-> Give word to {GetCurrentActor()} <<if HasTopicsForCurrentActor("CharacterToPlayer")>>
    Prince: You got something to say?
    <<jump TopicHubNPC>>

-> Finish conversation
    Prince: I think that's all for now.
    <<FinishConversation>>
    <<stop>>


